meta {
  name: Pay by mobile money
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/order-groups/{{group_id}}/pay/mobile-money
  body: json
}

body:json {
  {
    "phone": "0977123456",
    "network": "airtel"
  }
}

docs {
  Server-initiated: a USSD push to the handset. There is no browser to open the
  inline widget in, which is why this exists at all.

  The response is **pending**, not paid. Poll **Payment status**; the server
  decides by asking Lenco and by consuming the `collection.successful` webhook,
  never by trusting the client.
}
